{"last_link_id": 742, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# Qwen Image 2.1 · 单图/双图/多图总控\n\n## 使用方法\n\n1. **图1固定为编辑目标**，始终启用。\n2. 顶部红色控制台中，每个按钮对应一张参考图。\n3. 所有参考图默认关闭：此时就是单图编辑。\n4. 打开“参考图2”：变成双图编辑；继续打开即可变成多图编辑。\n5. 提示词中使用 `<image1>`、`<image2>`……明确每张图的职责。\n\n不要打开没有选择有效图片的参考图开关。\n\n## 官方参数\n\n- Steps：40-50\n- CFG：1\n- Sampler：Euler\n- Scheduler：Simple\n- Negative Prompt：空\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "快速使用", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 650], "pos": [0, 570], "id": 463, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# 官方模型结构树\n\n```text\nComfyUI/\n└── models/\n    ├── diffusion_models/\n    │   ├── qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors\n    │   └── qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    ├── text_encoders/\n    │   ├── qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors\n    │   ├── qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    │   └── qwen3vl_8b_w4a8.safetensors\n    └── vae/\n        └── qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\n模型仓库：\n\n- https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1\n\n当前工作流默认选择BF16扩散模型＋BF16文本编码器；观众可按显存直接在绿色子图中切换官方INT8或W4A8权重，其他节点无需修改。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "官方模型结构树", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 530], "pos": [0, 0], "id": 476, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#263342", "widgets_values": ["# custom_size 与像素说明\n\n## custom_size 关闭\n\n- 最终画布跟随 **图1** 的尺寸与宽高比。\n- 宽高会对齐到 32 的倍数。\n- 下方“分辨率选择器”不参与最终尺寸。\n\n## custom_size 开启\n\n- 最终画布由“分辨率选择器”的 **比例＋像素量** 决定。\n- 建议选择接近图1的宽高比，否则编辑内容可能发生位移或重新构图。\n\n## 像素量是什么\n\n这里的 MP 是**宽×高的总像素预算**，不是单边长度：\n\n- 1MP、1:1 ≈ `1024 × 1024`\n- 1MP、4:3 ≈ `1184 × 896`\n- 1MP、3:2 ≈ `1248 × 832`\n- 1MP、16:9 ≈ `1376 × 768`\n\n由于宽高按 32 对齐，实际总像素会与目标 MP 略有差异。\n\n补充：子图里的 `resolution = 0` 控制的是参考图编码尺寸，表示尽量保持原图；如果指定分辨率如1280直接填写即可。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "尺寸说明 · custom_size / 像素", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#111827", "size": [450, 590], "pos": [2.62456723021387e-13, 1282.08544921875], "id": 491, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "作者：B站-是古手梨花sama", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [3746, 300], "pos": [787.24267578125, -965.1766357421875], "id": 492, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "left", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "angle": 0, "fontSize": 300, "fontColor": "#3CB371"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [728], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [300, 314], "pos": [880, 300], "widgets_values": ["aa68a056567b17f54490ca4609e5cb11bfc29d8bdea382a75bfc74d3048d7a82.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 475, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "图2 · 参考输入", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.36.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [704], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [300, 314], "pos": [520, 300], "widgets_values": ["3e242f8d3c09ffbcaf92e2b9f8e3c12962424e1399554d4317a85a78ea98c21e.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "l